        cx: "Part of Riachuelo's production is outsourced to external suppliers, which requires control of terms, volumes and supplier commitments within a base of more than 400 suppliers.",
        ch: "Management of external production suppliers ran on Excel spreadsheets, with low control and traceability, outside the SAP core.",
        ap: "As Senior Manager of Supply Chain Data & Technology, bridging the business and IT, led the discovery of SAP standard modules to find a native solution instead of custom development, and translated the supplier management needs into requirements for SAP contracts.",
        r: ["Solution kept within the SAP core, using contracts to manage external production","Custom development avoided by adopting standard functionality","Supplier management moved out of spreadsheets"],
